  "title": "XML: Add UDP port range pref, set 3702 (WS-Discovery)",
  "description": "UDP port 3702 is IANA registered for WS-Discovery, which is\nimplemented as SOAP-over-UDP\n\nWe have a port range preference for TCP; add one for UDP, and\nset 3702 to that. (There is a heuristic dissector for XML over\nUDP, but it's off by default.)\n\nFix #19364",
